---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import "../styles/global.css";
import { getAssetMetadata, getAssetUrl } from "../utils/assets";

const fotoPerfil = getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-perfil");
const albertoProject = getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-presentacion");

const gallery = [
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-7"), alt: "FC Barcelona vs Real Madrid - UWCL 2021/22 Cuartos de Final (vuelta) [30/03/2022]" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-6"), alt: "Real Madrid vs Espanyol - La Liga 2021/22 Jornada 34 [30/04/2022]" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-3"), alt: "Foto con Caroline Møller" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-4"), alt: "Foto con Misa Rodríguez" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-5"), alt: "Foto con Athenea del Castillo" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-11"), alt: "Chelsea vs Real Madrid - UWCL 2023/24 Fase de grupos Jornada 5 [24/01/2024]" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-12"), alt: "Foto con Olga Carmona" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-13"), alt: "Foto en la Pista Central de Roma" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-1"), alt: "Athletic Club vs Real Madrid - Liga F 2024/25 Jornada 20 [02/03/25]" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-8"), alt: "Foto con Laia López" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-9"), alt: "Foto con Silvia Cristóbal" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-10"), alt: "Foto con Irune Dorado" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-2"), alt: "España vs Alemania - Final Women's Nations League 2025 (vuelta) [02/12/2025]" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-14"), alt: "Real Madrid vs FC Barcelona - Supercopa de España 2026 Final [24/01/2026]" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-15"), alt: "Foto con Merle Frohms" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-19"), alt: "Foto con María Méndez" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-17"), alt: "Foto con Hanna Bennison" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-18"), alt: "Foto con Sara Däbritz" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-20"), alt: "Foto con Linda Caicedo" },
  { src: getAssetMetadata("galeria", "foto-21"), alt: "Real Madrid vs Manchester City - UWCL 2026/27 Fase Liga Jornada 2 [01/10/2026]" },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Sobre Nosotros | Madrid Femenino Xtra"
  description="Conoce al equipo de redacción de Madrid Femenino Xtra. La mejor cobertura sobre la actualidad del Real Madrid Femenino."
>
  <div class="sn-page">

    <section class="sn-section">
      <header class="page-header-container">
        <h1 class="landing-title">EL PROYECTO</h1>
        <p class="landing-subtitle">Construyendo la mayor base de datos histórica del Real Madrid Femenino</p>
      </header>

      <div class="proyecto-grid">
        <div class="proyecto-text">
          <p>Madrid Femenino Xtra nace en septiembre de 2023 ante la necesidad de ofrecer una cobertura exclusiva y profesional del día a día del Real Madrid Femenino. Nuestro objetivo es ser la referencia para todos los aficionados que buscan seguir de cerca la actualidad, noticias y estadísticas de la sección femenina del club blanco.</p>
          <p>El proyecto comenzó en X y a lo largo de su corta pero intensa existencia se expandió a Instagram, TikTok y YouTube. En diciembre de 2025 dio el siguiente paso lanzando su propia página web: un proyecto con el objetivo de construir la mayor base de datos histórica del Real Madrid Femenino, con datos y estadísticas de todas las jugadoras, entrenadores, partidos, rivales, estadios, árbitras y rankings, incluyendo gráficos interactivos, desde su fundación en 2020.</p>
          <p>Todos los contenidos y estadísticas se elaboran mediante un proceso de investigación, contraste y revisión de fuentes oficiales y datos propios. La base de datos se actualiza continuamente para corregir errores, completar temporadas anteriores y ofrecer información clara, verificable y accesible sobre la evolución del Real Madrid Femenino.</p>
          <p>La estructura, organización y compilación de la presente base de datos están inscritas en el <a href="https://www.comunidad.madrid/inversion/inicia-desarrolla-tu-empresa/registro-territorial-propiedad-intelectual" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Registro Territorial de la Propiedad Intelectual</a> con el número de solicitud <strong>09/448957.9/26</strong>. El autor declara haber realizado una inversión sustancial de <strong>más de 500 horas</strong> de investigación y verificación manual. Cualquier uso de estos datos debe ser autorizado previamente por escrito por el titular: <strong>Alberto Arregui Jiménez</strong>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="proyecto-photo">
          <div class="proyecto-photo-frame">
            <Image
              src={albertoProject as any}
              alt="Alberto en presentación del proyecto"
              width={600}
              height={400}
              format="webp"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="sn-divider"><span>♦</span></div>

    <section class="sn-section">
      <header class="page-header-container">
        <h2 class="landing-title">DIRECCIÓN</h2>
        <p class="landing-subtitle">La persona que impulsa Madrid Femenino Xtra</p>
      </header>

      <div class="equipo-grid">
        <div class="team-card">
          <span class="tc-corner tc-tl"></span>
          <span class="tc-corner tc-tr"></span>
          <span class="tc-corner tc-bl"></span>
          <span class="tc-corner tc-br"></span>

          <div class="tc-avatar-wrap">
            <Image
              src={fotoPerfil as any}
              alt="Alberto Arregui"
              class="tc-avatar"
              width={200}
              height={200}
              format="webp"
            />
          </div>
          <h3 class="tc-name"><a href="/autor/alberto-arregui">Alberto Arregui</a></h3>
          <p class="tc-role">♦ Founder ♦</p>
          <p class="tc-bio">Creador y director de Madrid Femenino Xtra. Siguiendo al Real Madrid Femenino desde 2019.</p>
          <div class="tc-social">
            <a href="https://x.com/albertxx98rmcf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="X">
              <img src={getAssetUrl("redes", "x")} alt="X" width="18" height="18" />
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/alberto_arregui/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram">
              <img src={getAssetUrl("redes", "instagram")} alt="Instagram" width="18" height="18" />
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@alberto__arregui" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="TikTok">
              <img src={getAssetUrl("redes", "tiktok")} alt="TikTok" width="18" height="18" />
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@arreguiontour" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube">
              <img src={getAssetUrl("redes", "youtube")} alt="YouTube" width="18" height="18" />
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alberto-arregui/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M8 11v5"/><path d="M8 8v.01"/>
                <path d="M12 16v-5"/>
                <path d="M16 16v-3a2 2 0 1 0 -4 0"/>
                <path d="M3 7a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4h10a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v10a4 4 0 0 1 -4 4h-10a4 4 0 0 1 -4 -4l0 -10"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="sn-divider"><span>♦</span></div>

    <section class="sn-section galeria-section">
      <header class="page-header-container" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
        <h2 class="landing-title">GALERÍA</h2>
        <p class="landing-subtitle">Momentos vividos siguiendo al Real Madrid Femenino</p>
      </header>

      <div class="galeria-grid" id="gallery-grid">
        {gallery.map((img, index) => (
          <div class="galeria-item" data-index={index}>
            <Image
              src={img.src as any}
              alt={img.alt}
              width={600}
              height={400}
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <div id="lightbox" class="lightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Visor de la galería">
    <button class="lightbox-close" aria-label="Cerrar">&times;</button>
    <div class="lightbox-stage">
      <button class="lightbox-prev" aria-label="Anterior">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 6l-6 6l6 6"/></svg>
      </button>
      <figure class="lightbox-content">
        <img src="" alt="" class="lightbox-image" />
        <figcaption class="lightbox-caption"></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <button class="lightbox-next" aria-label="Siguiente">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6l-6 6"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline define:vars={{ galleryItems: gallery.map((img) => ({ src: img.src?.src, alt: img.alt })) }}>
    const lightbox = document.getElementById("lightbox");
    const lightboxImg = lightbox.querySelector(".lightbox-image");
    const lightboxCaption = lightbox.querySelector(".lightbox-caption");
    const closeBtn = lightbox.querySelector(".lightbox-close");
    const prevBtn = lightbox.querySelector(".lightbox-prev");
    const nextBtn = lightbox.querySelector(".lightbox-next");
    const items = document.querySelectorAll(".galeria-item");
    let currentIndex = 0;

    function renderCurrentImage() {
      const current = galleryItems[currentIndex];
      lightboxImg.src = current.src;
      lightboxImg.alt = current.alt;
      lightboxCaption.textContent = current.alt;
    }
    function openLightbox(index) {
      currentIndex = index;
      renderCurrentImage();
      lightbox.classList.add("active");
      document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";
    }
    function closeLightbox() {
      lightbox.classList.remove("active");
      document.body.style.overflow = "";
    }
    function showNext() {
      currentIndex = (currentIndex + 1) % galleryItems.length;
      renderCurrentImage();
    }
    function showPrev() {
      currentIndex = (currentIndex - 1 + galleryItems.length) % galleryItems.length;
      renderCurrentImage();
    }

    items.forEach((item, index) => item.addEventListener("click", () => openLightbox(index)));
    closeBtn.addEventListener("click", closeLightbox);
    nextBtn.addEventListener("click", (e) => { e.stopPropagation(); showNext(); });
    prevBtn.addEventListener("click", (e) => { e.stopPropagation(); showPrev(); });
    lightbox.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
      if (e.target === lightbox || e.target.classList.contains("lightbox-content")) closeLightbox();
    });
    document.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
      if (!lightbox.classList.contains("active")) return;
      if (e.key === "Escape") closeLightbox();
      if (e.key === "ArrowRight") showNext();
      if (e.key === "ArrowLeft") showPrev();
    });

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) { entry.target.classList.add("visible"); observer.unobserve(entry.target); }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.1 });
    items.forEach((item) => observer.observe(item));
  </script>
</Layout>

<style>
.sn-page {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 1.5rem 5rem;
}

.sn-section { margin-bottom: 1rem; }

.sn-divider {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin: 3rem auto;
  max-width: 900px;
}
.sn-divider::before, .sn-divider::after {
  content: '';
  flex: 1;
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(212,168,67,0.2));
}
.sn-divider::after { background: linear-gradient(to left, transparent, rgba(212,168,67,0.2)); }
.sn-divider span {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: rgba(212,168,67,0.35);
}

.proyecto-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: start;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.proyecto-text p {
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  line-height: 1.85;
  color: rgba(200,210,220,0.7);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.proyecto-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.proyecto-text strong { color: rgba(240,240,240,0.9); font-weight: 600; }
.proyecto-text a {
  color: rgba(212,168,67,0.75);
  text-decoration: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.25);
  transition: color 0.2s;
}
.proyecto-text a:hover { color: #d4a843; }

.proyecto-photo-frame {
  position: relative;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.2);
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.proyecto-photo-frame::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;
  width: 16px; height: 16px;
  border-top: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.6);
  border-left: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.6);
  z-index: 2;
}
.proyecto-photo-frame::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 0;
  width: 16px; height: 16px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.6);
  border-right: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.6);
  z-index: 2;
}
.proyecto-photo-frame img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
  filter: brightness(0.9);
  transition: filter 0.3s;
}
.proyecto-photo-frame:hover img { filter: brightness(1); }

.equipo-grid {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  max-width: 420px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.team-card {
  background: rgba(8,16,34,0.85);
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.18);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  transition: border-color 0.25s;
}
.team-card:hover { border-color: rgba(212,168,67,0.4); }

.tc-corner {
  position: absolute;
  width: 14px; height: 14px;
  transition: width 0.25s, height 0.25s, border-color 0.25s;
}
.tc-tl { top: 0; left: 0; border-top: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.45); border-left: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.45); }
.tc-tr { top: 0; right: 0; border-top: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.45); border-right: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.45); }
.tc-bl { bottom: 0; left: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.45); border-left: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.45); }
.tc-br { bottom: 0; right: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.45); border-right: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.45); }
.team-card:hover .tc-corner { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-color: #d4a843; }

.tc-avatar-wrap {
  width: 140px;
  height: 140px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 2px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.3);
  transition: border-color 0.25s;
}
.team-card:hover .tc-avatar-wrap { border-color: rgba(212,168,67,0.65); }
.tc-avatar { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

.tc-name {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #f0f0f0;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
}

.tc-role {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  color: rgba(212,168,67,0.65);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
}

.tc-bio {
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: rgba(200,210,220,0.55);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
}

.tc-social {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.65rem;
}
.tc-social a {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 34px; height: 34px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.18);
  border-radius: 2px;
  color: rgba(200,210,220,0.5);
  transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
}
.tc-social a:hover {
  border-color: rgba(212,168,67,0.55);
  color: #d4a843;
  background: rgba(212,168,67,0.06);
}
.tc-social img { filter: brightness(0) invert(1); opacity: 0.55; transition: opacity 0.2s, filter 0.2s; }
.tc-social a:hover img { opacity: 1; filter: brightness(0) saturate(100%) invert(79%) sepia(13%) saturate(1966%) hue-rotate(1077deg) brightness(88%) contrast(87%); }

.galeria-section { margin-bottom: 2rem; }

.galeria-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  grid-auto-rows: 220px;
  gap: 0.4rem;
}

.galeria-item {
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 2px;
  cursor: pointer;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(20px);
  transition: opacity 0.5s ease-out, transform 0.5s ease-out;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.08);
}
.galeria-item.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
.galeria-item:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(212,168,67,0.3); }
.galeria-item img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
  transition: transform 0.45s ease, filter 0.3s;
  filter: brightness(0.88);
}
.galeria-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); filter: brightness(1); }

.lightbox {
  position: fixed; inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.96);
  z-index: 10000;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  transition: opacity 0.25s, visibility 0.25s;
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
}
.lightbox.active { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }

.lightbox-stage {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  max-width: calc(100vw - 2rem);
  max-height: 94vh;
}

.lightbox-content {
  position: relative;
  width: fit-content;
  max-width: 90vw;
  max-height: 92vh;
  margin: 0;
  padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.lightbox-image {
  display: block;
  max-width: 90vw;
  max-height: calc(92vh - 4.5rem);
  object-fit: contain;
  border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.15);
}
.lightbox-caption {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  min-height: 4.5rem;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(6,13,28,0.94);
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.15);
  border-top: 0;
  border-radius: 0 0 2px 2px;
  color: rgba(240,240,240,0.88);
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  line-height: 1.45;
  text-align: center;
}

.lightbox-close {
  position: absolute; top: 1.5rem; right: 1.75rem;
  background: none; border: none;
  color: rgba(200,210,220,0.6);
  font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1;
  cursor: pointer; z-index: 1;
  transition: color 0.2s;
}
.lightbox-close:hover { color: #d4a843; }

.lightbox-prev, .lightbox-next {
  position: absolute; top: calc(50% - 2.25rem); transform: translateY(-50%);
  background: rgba(6,13,28,0.7);
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.22);
  color: rgba(200,210,220,0.7);
  width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 2px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  cursor: pointer; z-index: 1;
  transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
}
.lightbox-prev:hover, .lightbox-next:hover {
  background: rgba(212,168,67,0.12);
  border-color: rgba(212,168,67,0.55);
  color: #d4a843;
}
.lightbox-prev { left: 0.65rem; }
.lightbox-next { right: 0.65rem; }

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .galeria-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); grid-auto-rows: 200px; }
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .proyecto-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
  .proyecto-photo { order: -1; }
  .galeria-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); grid-auto-rows: 180px; }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .sn-page { padding: 0 1.25rem 3rem; }
  .sobre-hero { padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem; }
  .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  .team-grid { gap: 1.25rem; }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .galeria-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); grid-auto-rows: 150px; }
  .lightbox-stage { max-width: calc(100vw - 1rem); }
  .lightbox-content { max-width: calc(100vw - 1rem); padding-bottom: 5.5rem; }
  .lightbox-image { max-width: calc(100vw - 1rem); max-height: calc(88vh - 5.5rem); }
  .lightbox-caption { min-height: 5.5rem; padding: 0.65rem 2.9rem; font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .lightbox-prev { left: 0.35rem; }
  .lightbox-next { right: 0.35rem; }
  .sn-page { padding: 0 0.75rem 3rem; }
  .member-card { padding: 1.25rem 1rem; }
}
</style>
